OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F147A1768760867
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G1/9
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GOPINION CCould red button provide a
OL,4,Cmore inclusive TV experience for BSL
OL,5,Cviewers
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne principle of public service
OL,8,Fbroadcasting is that it should be
OL,9,Favailable to all.
OL,11,FSubtitles, audio description and sign
OL,12,Flanguage interpretation are hugely
OL,13,Fimportant services.
OL,23,EPub: 21-Dec-2025Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,148,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14702
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F147A1768760867
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G2/9
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GOPINION CCould red button provide a
OL,4,Cmore inclusive TV experience for BSL
OL,5,Cviewers
OL,6,
OL,7,FSubtitles are, of course, easy to turn
OL,8,Foff and on. They aren't just used by
OL,9,Fpeople with profound hearing
OL,10,Fdifficulties. They are valued by some
OL,11,Fother viewers too. Perhaps a slight
OL,12,Fhearing difficulty makes it hard for
OL,13,Fthem to distinguish some speech? Or
OL,14,Fmaybe they just want to keep the sound
OL,15,Flow to avoid disturbing someone?
OL,17,FAudio description is a useful service
OL,18,Ffor those with poor eyesight and the
OL,19,Fblind.
OL,23,EPub: 21-Dec-2025Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,148,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14703
SC,0003
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F147A1768760867
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G3/9
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GOPINION CCould red button provide a
OL,4,Cmore inclusive TV experience for BSL
OL,5,Cviewers
OL,6,
OL,7,FBoth these services can, of course,
OL,8,Fsimply be turned off and on. There is
OL,9,Fno downside or distraction for other
OL,10,Fviewers.
OL,12,FTraditionally sign language
OL,13,Finterpretation has been more
OL,14,Fproblematic.
OL,16,FAround 150,000 people in the UK use
OL,17,FBritish Sign Language. Many of its
OL,18,Fusers have been deaf since birth. BSL
OL,19,Fis a language in its own right.
OL,23,EPub: 21-Dec-2025Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,148,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14704
SC,0004
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F147A1768760867
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G4/9
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GOPINION CCould red button provide a
OL,4,Cmore inclusive TV experience for BSL
OL,5,Cviewers
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut sign language interpretation can be
OL,8,Fa distraction for the majority of
OL,9,Fviewers, even those who would also
OL,10,Fsupport the principle of making
OL,11,Fprogrammes available to BSL.
OL,13,FThis is the reason BSL programmes are
OL,14,Fusually shown at off peak times or
OL,15,Fovernight to record.
OL,17,FBut is there now a way for the BBC to
OL,18,Fprovide more live BSL? The red button.
OL,23,EPub: 21-Dec-2025Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,148,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14705
SC,0005
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F147A1768760867
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G5/9
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GOPINION CCould red button provide a
OL,4,Cmore inclusive TV experience for BSL
OL,5,Cviewers
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn recent weeks several programmes `
OL,8,Fnotably Strictly ` have gone out with
OL,9,FBSL interpretation on the BBC's Red
OL,10,FButton service at the same time as the
OL,11,Fmain broadcast on BBC One.
OL,13,FSeveral programmes on Christmas Day and
OL,14,FBoxing Day are being interpreted in
OL,15,Fthis way including Call the Midwife.
OL,17,FSurely this is a better option than the
OL,18,Fovernight Sign Zone?
OL,23,EPub: 21-Dec-2025Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,148,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14706
SC,0006
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F147A1768760867
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G6/9
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GOPINION CCould red button provide a
OL,4,Cmore inclusive TV experience for BSL
OL,5,Cviewers
OL,6,
OL,7,FThis allows BSL users to watch
OL,8,Fprogrammes as they are shown along with
OL,9,Ftheir friends and family.
OL,11,FThe red button option effectively means
OL,12,Fsign language interpretation becomes an
OL,13,Foptional feature like subtitles and AD.
OL,15,FBBC cuts and changing commissioning
OL,16,Fpriorities mean there is now far less
OL,17,Foriginal red button video content.
OL,23,EPub: 21-Dec-2025Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,148,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14707
SC,0007
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F147A1768760867
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G7/9
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GOPINION CCould red button provide a
OL,4,Cmore inclusive TV experience for BSL
OL,5,Cviewers
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt present the red button video stream
OL,8,Fis mostly being used for endless reruns
OL,9,Fof Fanny Cradock Cooks for Christmas
OL,10,Ffrom 1975.
OL,12,FSurely it would be sensible to turn
OL,13,Fthis stream over so that it be
OL,14,Fprimarily a BSL service?
OL,16,FOver time, the need for the overnight
OL,17,FSIgn Zone could be reconsidered.
OL,23,EPub: 21-Dec-2025Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,148,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14708
SC,0008
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F147A1768760867
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G8/9
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GOPINION CCould red button provide a
OL,4,Cmore inclusive TV experience for BSL
OL,5,Cviewers
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe BBC deserves credit for providing
OL,8,FBSL on a wide range of programmes each
OL,9,Fweek. It does not cynically repeat
OL,10,Fprogrammes made years ago to tick
OL,11,Fboxes.
OL,13,FUntil now, Sign Zone and the iPlayer
OL,14,Fwere clearly the best ways of
OL,15,Fdelivering this service.
OL,17,FBut I really think providing the option
OL,18,Fof BSL on the red button channel at the
OL,19,Fsame time as the main transmission
OL,20,Fshould be the way forward.
OL,23,EPub: 21-Dec-2025Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,148,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14709
SC,0009
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F147A1768760867
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G9/9
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GOPINION CCould red button provide a
OL,4,Cmore inclusive TV experience for BSL
OL,5,Cviewers
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe joy of a channel like BBC One is
OL,8,Fits ability to bring people together.
OL,9,FThose who use BSL should be able to
OL,10,Ffeel welcome too and, via the red
OL,11,Fbutton, enjoy programmes at the same
OL,12,Ftime as the rest of us.
OL,23,EPub: 21-Dec-2025Upppppppppppppppppppppp
